    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a private luxury yacht on a dark and stormy night; humor abound in this point &amp; click adventure. Do you like games with evil witches? What about sandwiches? Maybe bad demons or headless horsemen? It's all here in SOS (Save Our Sandwiches).</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features inventory (access and exit inventory with ESC key)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the screen to see a description of the room objects or get an item or change camera angle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features lots of ambience such as raining visuals and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load game any time and access the save point to save the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore inside and outside of private luxury yacht, save the people aboard, and defeat the evils</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a private luxury yacht on a dark and stormy night; humor abound in this point &amp; click adventure. Do you like games with evil witches? What about sandwiches? Maybe bad demons or headless horsemen? It's all here in SOS (Save Our Sandwiches).</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features inventory (access and exit inventory with ESC key)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the screen to see a description of the room objects or get an item or change camera angle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features lots of ambience such as raining visuals and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load game any time and access the save point to save the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore inside and outside of private luxury yacht, save the people aboard, and defeat the evils</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Point &amp; click aboard a private luxury yacht on a dark and stormy night with funny evil witches and sandwiches Features rain effects, exploration of an entire ship, puzzles, and monsters",
